  unitName: Thief Leon
  unitId: 10061
  unitNumber: 79
  description: A bandit ruling the territories around the ruined Agni Empire. Raised
    in an orphanage, he left in a rage knowing that Imperial subsidies were being
    embezzled by a vicious official. He then made his name as a bandit, targeting
    detestable government officials, soldiers and merchants. Wielding dual-knives,
    he's known to hurt, but never kill his targets.
  summonDesc: You need my help?<br>Alright, but in exchange,<br>I'll be taking a
    large reward.
  fusionDesc: So you want more from me?<br>Hah! How's this!
